platform-x: read-only Rust X web-session adapter

The HTTP operation variables, selected legacy feature defaults and response
shape handling reference/adapt Twikit, not an original discovery attributed to
this project:

  d60/twikit
  https://github.com/d60/twikit
  Fixed revision: c3b7220866f8582009fe2d1155b6fe92192a2711
  Copyright (c) 2024 d60
  MIT; original notice and license: LICENSE-TWIKIT
  Referenced files: twikit/client/{client,gql,v11}.py, constants.py,
  x_client_transaction/{transaction,cubic_curve,interpolate,rotation,utils}.py.

The transaction generator, animation interpolation, cubic curve, rotation and
floating-point hexadecimal encoding in src/transaction.rs are Rust translations
and bounded adaptations of the separate upstream XClientTransaction project:

  iSarabjitDhiman/XClientTransaction
  https://github.com/iSarabjitDhiman/XClientTransaction
  Fixed revision: f33670478bf799c2c10b33894c97347ccb9904a1
  Copyright (c) 2025 Sarabjit Dhiman
  MIT; original notice and license: LICENSE-XCLIENTTRANSACTION
  Referenced files: x_client_transaction/{transaction,cubic_curve,interpolate,
  rotation,utils,constants}.py. This separate license was checked independently
  of Twikit's top-level MIT license.

Changes include replacing Python/BeautifulSoup with bounded Rust extraction,
no JavaScript execution, explicit errors instead of implicit defaults, OS random
bytes, bounded cubic iterations, static host restrictions and static public
errors. The original transaction algorithm and upstream authorship are retained.

Current x-web operation/variable/result field metadata was independently checked
against publicly served X homepage and JavaScript assets on 2026-10-31. The
downloaded JavaScript is parsed as data, never executed. X scripts, trademarks,
service and account entitlements are not relicensed by this crate. Only synthetic
fixtures and small protocol field names/values are included in source; public
page/script corpora used for optional offline checks remain outside the crate.

No upstream Python package, browser, JavaScript engine, Node, Bun or V8 is linked
or executed by this adapter. No credential or account data is included.
